    {
      "position": 1,
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "text": "Note that you would not normally say 貧乏でいるよりもむしろ金持ちがいい, but you would say 貧乏でいるよりも、やっぱり金持ちがいい。",
      "html": "Note that you would not normally say 貧乏でいるよりもむしろ金持ちがいい, but you would say 貧乏でいるよりも、やっぱり金持ちがいい。",
      "source_id": null,
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "text": "Grammatically yes, but I think the intended meaning was the other way around... Amatuka prefers being poor :)",
      "html": "Grammatically yes, but I think the intended meaning was the other way around... Amatuka prefers being poor :)",
      "source_id": null,
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "text": "Now that \"Yappari\" is official, the \"see also\" reference makes sense, notwithstanding the fact that Amatuka wants to remain poor.",
      "html": "Now that \"Yappari\" is official, the \"see also\" reference makes sense, notwithstanding the fact that Amatuka wants to remain poor.",
      "source_id": null,
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
